{"name": "Die to Play", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You found yourself in an estate, where an ancient retro computer runs a strange, cursed game\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>As you dive deeper, you\u2019ll realize: the game is more than just a game. Every match is a step toward the truth \u2014 and your survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>\"But here, losing isn\u2019t the only way to die.\"</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/d2e7c39922acf758d3721fd49d5314e3.avif?t=1787244977\" width=\"780\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/6c7d6e6ab1dfc7ace2bcbf63c9711f34.poster.avif?t=1787244977\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/6c7d6e6ab1dfc7ace2bcbf63c9711f34.webm?t=1787244977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/6c7d6e6ab1dfc7ace2bcbf63c9711f34.mp4?t=1787244977\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Fight in a pixelated 2D game, then step away from the screen and explore the 3D mansion where it all takes place. The two worlds are connected \u2014 and the game knows what you\u2019re doing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/0509fa3e86a9854a9c60093d8a3d6057.avif?t=1787244977\" width=\"780\"/></span><i>Something is seriously wrong with this game. Piece together what happened in the mansion, who created it, and why you were pulled into it before the game decides what happens to you.</i> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/682dfd7b7502054598767212883fd92b.avif?t=1787244977\" width=\"780\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"462\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/2584f4336e50dc8762d7b2a721963e49.poster.avif?t=1787244977\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/2584f4336e50dc8762d7b2a721963e49.webm?t=1787244977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/2584f4336e50dc8762d7b2a721963e49.mp4?t=1787244977\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will die. A lot. But every death gives you something new \u2014 a shortcut, a clue, a new mechanic, or a piece of the story that makes the next run go further.</i> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/8dc43875c3006b1e5eeb5c7f8fb18614.avif?t=1787244977\" width=\"780\"/></span><i>You\u2019re not just playing a game \u2014 you\u2019re trapped inside one. Boot up the strange retro game on an old PC and see how its events start bleeding into the mansion around you. </i> <br/> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Die to Play \u2014 a deckbuilder with dice, set on a cozy retro computer inside a medieval English mansion filled with horrors and mysteries.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/c65d659e61f2c69f96088b041ba7ceab2463dec5/header.jpg?t=1787244977", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Battler", "Roguelite", "Card Game", "Point & Click", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelike"], "developers": "Kvinter games", "publishers": "Kvinter games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3784360", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/rHLu8Uuf1vg", "first_seen": 1777500000.0, "review_rank": 739}